2026-05-24 fix-functional-blender-runtime-v3

Symptom:
RCS/marker effects visible, imported Blender Scout body effectively missing in the player Game View.

Root cause:
SimpleFollowCamera visual bounds included non-ship imported/socket/marker renderers under PrototypeShip.
Before fix:
- VisualBoundsRadius=22.21
- EffectiveDistance=59.30
- VisualBoundsRendererCount=84
- Imported Scout body bounds were only about 2.42 x 1.60 x 4.39.

Fix:
SimpleFollowCamera now prefers ImportedShipVisual when it is active and only uses real DEMO_* ship mesh renderers for imported-ship camera bounds.
The imported body-renderer filter is centralized in PrototypeShipVisualBoundsUtility and excludes sockets, CONN_* connector markers, hardpoints, nozzles, muzzles, turret markers, VFX, rings, labels, debug, and marker renderers.
Generated/fallback ships still use the previous general bounds path.

After fix:
- VisualBoundsRadius=2.63
- EffectiveDistance=18.00
- VisualBoundsRendererCount=43
- GameView screenshot shows the imported Scout body centered and readable.

